OL,3,GNEWSAAre we still in love with August
OL,4,Abank holiday weddings?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe August bank holiday is always
OL,7,Fpopular for last minute getaways,
OL,8,Ffestivals or trips to the beach.
OL,10,FIt has also traditionally been one of
OL,11,Fthe busiest times of the year for
OL,12,Fweddings, with the combination of warm
OL,13,Fweather and a long weekend making it
OL,14,Fthe first choice for many couples
OL,15,Flooking to tie the knot.
OL,17,FBut as trends and weather patterns
OL,18,Fchange, are West Midlands brides and
OL,19,Fgrooms turning away from the popular
OL,20,Fdate?
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
