OL,3,GNEWSAAre we still in love with August
OL,4,Abank holiday weddings?
OL,5,
OL,6,FKelly Walker from Stockton in
OL,7,FWarwickshire is due to marry her
OL,8,Flong-term partner Pete Jones over the
OL,9,Fweekend.
